urs: Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday, 10 AM–2 PM; Wednesday, 3–7 PM. Check with the pantry about holiday changes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Where: Hilltop Youth Empowerment Center, 3275 Sullivant Ave., Columbus, OH 43204."}]}]},"buttons":[{"label":"Plan Your First Pantry Visit","href":"/services#option-get-help-0","style":"primary"},{"label":"Call the Pantry","href":"tel:6148867849","style":"link"}]},{"eyebrow":"Request an appointment · Free healthcare","title":"Hilltop Free Clinic","doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Preventive screenings, primary care and health navigation for eligible uninsured adults."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"How to get help: request an appointment. The clinic team will confirm eligibility, a date and the visit location. Sending a request does not book an appointment."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clinics run on select Saturdays. Contact the team for the next available session and what to bring. Interpretation is available."}]}]},"buttons":[{"label":"Request a Clinic Appointment","href":"/services#section-clinic-request","style":"primary"},{"label":"Clinic Details & Languages","href":"/free-clinic","style":"link"}]},{"eyebrow":"Walk in · Free meals","title":"The Community Table & MY Soup Kitchen","doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Free hot meals for neighbors who need them. This is the meal assistance program; café takeout and catering are separate paid services."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"How to get help: come during meal service. Meals are first come, first served; no online signup is required."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Published meal hours: Tuesday–Saturday, noon–3 PM, at 3275 Sullivant Ave. Call before travelling to confirm the current schedule."}]}]},"buttons":[{"label":"Meal Program Details